<Page
  title="Privacy Policy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  description="How bla5k handles data, cookies, analytics, and third-party advertising."
  updated={updated}
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>bla5k</strong> (“we”, “us”) collects and
    uses information when you visit <strong>bla5k.com</strong> (the “Site”). By using the
    Site, you agree to the practices described here.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    bla5k is primarily an informational directory. We do not ask you to create an account
    or submit personal details to browse. We may automatically collect standard technical
    data such as your browser type, device, approximate location, and the pages you view —
    the same data most websites log.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small files stored on your device. We and our partners use them to
    understand how the Site is used and to improve your experience. You can disable cookies
    in your browser settings, though some features may not work as intended.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We may use analytics services (such as Google Analytics and Cloudflare Web Analytics)
    to measure traffic and improve the Site. These services collect aggregated,
    non-identifying usage data.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising &amp; third-party vendors</h2>
  <p>
    We may display advertising, including through <strong>Google AdSense</strong>.
    Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior
    visits to this and other websites. Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and
    its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
    <li>You can learn more about your choices at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some outbound links on this Site may be affiliate links. See our
    <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a> page for details. Clicking them does not change
    what you pay.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, or delete data
    held about you. To make a request, contact us via the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.
    Your use of the Site is also governed by our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. The “last updated” date above reflects the
    most recent revision.
  </p>

